(`meta-llama/Llama-Prompt-Guard-2-22M`). Those model weights are NOT part of
this repository, are NOT distributed with it, and are NOT covered by the
Apache License above. They are obtained at run time by the operator from the
Hugging Face gated repository, under the operator's own acceptance of:

